      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 11 months ago",
      "body": "There's a \"Tug of War\" event going on tomorrow that we'll be going to and if the weather isn't too horrible it will be a blast!!  Do you guys know what a tug of war is?? If you do, there is a little twist on this one, it's across the water with the opposing tugging teams on either side!!\nHere's the link to the event,\nhttp://www.themre.org/tug2008/index.html\nit will explain more and you'll see exactly what we'll be doing, Mike may even get in on being a \"tugger\" LOL!  Alot of the proceeds from the event will go to Aaralyn's school 😀\nThis has been going on for many years, even though Eastport is actually part of the city of Annapolis, the Eastportians (myself being one now 😀 ) want Eastport to be it's own little city, The Maritime Republic of Eastport vs Annapolis, it's an ongoing humorous rival going way back.\nhere's a link that has a little history about it if  you're interested\nhttp://www.themre.org/tughistory.html",
